{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026POqu189DCh1792988526.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>股評人阮子曦表示，內地稅務部門消息比較令港股敏感，上方先看23,600點，下方繼續看今年低位22,500點。</p><p></p><p>華富建業證券投資策略聯席總監阮子曦說︰「上周只有一個消息令港股跌下來，就是『收水』，消息而已。暫時來說，我仍覺得稅務消息比較令港股敏感，而這方面來說可看到，很少有官方渠道消息報道出來，即稅務局追收稅款不會報道。上方先看23,600點，下方我繼續看今年低位22,500點。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:43.514060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.838449+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:38:04.106952+00:00","content_hash":"f0d8345d7de96ec08494ef4c861e8796dcfe26626ccffade970faff9e15637fc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:40:43.514060+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}